- **addTagToNote()** (lines 53-74): Determines which tags to add and which to remove based on checkbox selections
- **removeTag()** (lines 87-94): Removes tag text from note title and content - **THIS IS THE KEY METHOD FOR REMOVING UNCHECKED TAGS**
